                0.159
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、已知 \\( y''(t)+5y'(t)+6y(t)=2x'(t)+x(t) \\) ， \\( x(t)=e^{-t}u(t) \\) ， \\( y(0_{-})= \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.184,
                0.164,
                0.458,
                0.182
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\( y'(0_{-})=1 \\) ，求系统的全响应 \\( y(t) \\) 。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.219,
                0.182,
                0.466,
                0.209
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\alpha^ {2} + 5 \\alpha + 6 = (\\alpha + 2) (\\alpha + 3) = 0\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.493,
                0.166,
                0.945,
                0.203
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n2 x ^ {\\prime} (t) + x (t) = 2 \\left[ - e ^ {- t} (u (t) + d (t)) \\right] + e ^ {- t} (u (t)) = - e ^ {t} (u (t) + 2 d (t))\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.209,
                0.402,
                0.236
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\alpha_ {1} = - 2, \\quad \\alpha_ {2} = - 3\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.501,
                0.202,
                0.89,
                0.233
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\( t > 0 \\) 时自由项 \\( =  - {e}^{ - t} \\) ,故选 \\( {y}_{p}\\left( t\\right)  = C{e}^{-t} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.22,
                0.232,
                0.446,
                0.272
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {h} (t) = A e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.526,
                0.235,
                0.811,
                0.295
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {C e ^ {- t} - 5 C e ^ {- t} + 6 C e ^ {- t}} & {= - e ^ {- t}} \\\\ {2 C = - 1 \\Rightarrow C = - \\frac {1}{2}} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.618,
                0.299,
                0.765,
                0.337
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {p} | t | = - \\frac {1}{2} e ^ {- t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.333,
                0.34,
                0.715,
                0.383
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {| t |} = y _ {n} | t | + y _ {p} | t | = A e ^ {- x t} + B e ^ {- 3 t} - \\frac {1}{2} e ^ {- t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.41,
                0.38,
                0.734,
                0.423
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny ^ {\\prime} (t) + 5 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 6 y (t) = - e ^ {- t} u (t) + 2 d (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.437,
                0.425,
                0.771,
                0.526
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {y ^ {\\prime} (t)} & {= a d (t) + b \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow a = 2} \\\\ {y ^ {\\prime} (t)} & {= a \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow y ^ {\\prime} (0 + 1) = y ^ {\\prime} (0 - 1) + a = 3} \\\\ {y ^ {\\prime} (t)} & {= a d (\\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow y (0 + 1) = y (0 - 1) = 1} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.385,
                0.53,
                0.796,
                0.613
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} y (0 + 1) = A + B - \\frac {1}{2} = 1 \\\\ y ^ {\\prime} (0 + 1) = - 2 A - 3 B + \\frac {1}{2} = 3 \\end{array} \\right. \\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} A = 7 \\\\ B = - \\frac {1 1}{2} \\end{array} \\right.\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.457,
                0.616,
                0.794,
                0.67
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {| t |} = (7 e ^ {- 2 t} - \\frac {1 1}{2} e ^ {- 3 t} - \\frac {1}{2} e ^ {- t}) u (t)\n\\]"
        },
