        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.183,
                0.11,
                0.812,
                0.177
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、LTI系统中微分方程为： \\( y''(t) + 5y'(t) + 6y(t) = 2x'(t) + 3x(t) \\) ， \\( y(0^-) = 2 \\) ， \\( y'(0^-) = 1 \\) ，输入信号 \\( x(t) = u(t) \\) ，请用时域分析法求：系统的自由响应和强迫响应。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.252,
                0.183,
                0.513,
                0.213
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\alpha^ {2} + 5 \\alpha + 6 = (\\alpha + 2) (\\alpha + 3) = 0\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.586,
                0.183,
                0.847,
                0.217
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n2 x (t) + 3 x (t) = 2 \\sqrt {1 - t} + 3 u (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.266,
                0.222,
                0.435,
                0.247
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\alpha_ {1} = - 2, \\quad \\alpha_ {2} = - 3\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.258,
                0.251,
                0.484,
                0.291
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {n} (t) = A e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.587,
                0.225,
                0.914,
                0.261
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "切时的项 \\( = 3 \\Rightarrow  {y}_{p + 1} = c \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.624,
                0.261,
                0.777,
                0.289
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n0 + 0 + 6 c = 3\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.672,
                0.289,
                0.747,
                0.318
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nc = \\frac {1}{2}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.661,
                0.319,
                0.76,
                0.357
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {p} | t | = \\frac {1}{2}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.371,
                0.359,
                0.752,
                0.409
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny | t | = y _ {h} | t | + y _ {p} | t | = A e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t} + \\frac {1}{2}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.353,
                0.413,
                0.685,
                0.456
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} | t | + 5 y ^ {\\prime} | t | + 6 y | t | = 2 0 (t) + 3 u (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.388,
                0.456,
                0.682,
                0.493
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a d (t) + b \\Delta (1 + t) \\Rightarrow a = 2\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.387,
                0.487,
                0.739,
                0.527
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny ^ {\\prime} | t | = a \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow y ^ {\\prime} (0 + 1) = y ^ {\\prime} (0 - 1) + a = 3\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.392,
                0.525,
                0.69,
                0.56
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny (t) = a t \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow y (0 + 1) = y (0 - 1) = 2\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.395,
                0.558,
                0.791,
                0.636
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} y (u + 1) = A + B + \\frac {1}{2} = 2 \\\\ y (0 + 1) = - 2 A - 3 B = 3 \\end{array} \\right. \\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} A = \\frac {1 5}{2} \\\\ B = - 6 \\end{array} \\right.\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.393,
                0.636,
                0.735,
                0.684
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny (t) = \\left(\\frac {1 5}{2} e ^ {- 2 t} - 6 e ^ {- 3 t} + \\frac {1}{2}\\right) u (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.395,
                0.683,
                0.748,
                0.725
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "自由向应为  \\( \\left(\\frac{15}{2}e^{-2t}-6e^{-3t}\\right)uHt \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.399,
                0.727,
                0.621,
                0.766
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "强矩响应为  \\( \\frac{1}{2}u(t) \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
