            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.194,
                0.293,
                0.374,
                0.31
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1) 系统的微分方程;",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.316,
                0.812,
                0.36
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) 若初始状态为 \\( y(0^-) = 1, y'(0^-) = 1 \\), 当输入 \\( f(t) = 2e^{-3t}u(t) \\) 时, 求系统的全响应 \\( y(t) \\)。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.195,
                0.365,
                0.527,
                0.41
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "解：(1) 设中间变量  \\( q(1) \\) ，如同文",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.23,
                0.409,
                0.831,
                0.499
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{则} 9 ^ {\\prime \\prime} | t |} & {= f | t | - 3 9 ^ {\\prime} | t | - 2 9 | t | \\Rightarrow f | t | = 9 ^ {\\prime \\prime} | t | + 3 9 ^ {\\prime} | t | + 2 9 | t |} \\\\ {y | t |} & {= 9 | t | + 2 9 ^ {\\prime} | t |} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.218,
                0.494,
                0.789,
                0.541
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "故系交微分方程为  \\( y^{i|t|} + 3y^{i|t|} + 2y^{i|t|} = 2f^{i|t|} + f^{i|t|} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.205,
                0.565,
                0.497,
                0.629
            ],
            "angle": 0,
